<title>HONG KONG: Korea Long sets $100 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Korea Long sets $100 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the joint lead managers .</p>
<p>BORROWER  KOREA LONG TERM CREDIT BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$100 MLN  COUPON     3ML+35 BP   MATURITY 364 DAYS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRN	   ISS PRICE  PAR	   REOFFER  99.95</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	  CALLS	NONE	  REPLIES  06.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING   LONDON	REPAYMENT  BULLET	DENOMS   US$250K</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW    ENGLISH     PAY DATE 16.MAY.97</p>
<p> RATING    **	    SALES LMTS STAMDARD    TAX PROV --</p>
<p> NEG PLE   YES	   CROSS DEF  YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> FEES	8 BP	  MGT &amp; UND  3 BP	  SELLING  5 BP</p>
<p>LEAD MGRS ABN AMRO HOARE GOVETT AND SAKURA FINANCE ASIA</p>
<p> NOTES     **ISSUED OFF US$2 BLN MEDIUM TERM NOTE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	     WHICH IS RATED A3 BY MOODY'S AND A-MINUS BY STANDARD</p>
<p>	     AND POOR'S CORP.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
